<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39364" root="نجث" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِيثٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>A hidden secret.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحِيثٌ</span>.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَا نَجِيثُ القَوْمِ</span> <i>The secret of the people, which
they concealed, became apparent,</i> or <i>revealed.</i>
(Fr, S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَتَانَا نَجِيثُ القَوْمِ</span> <i>The affair of the
people, which they kept secret, came to our knowledge.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِيْثَةٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِيثٌ</span> <i>What
attains its utmost aim</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ما بلغ</span>), of praise, or of
an encomium. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِيثٌ</span> <i>A butt at which
one shoots,</i> or <i>casts, consisting of earth collected
together:</i> (S, K:) or <i>earth that is taken forth,
and of which a butt is constructed, to shoot at,</i> or
<i>cast at.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْرٌ لَهُ نَجِيثٌ</span> <i>An affair that
has an evil end, conclusion, issue,</i> or <i>result.</i> (TA.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِيثٌ</span> <i>A certain leguminous plant.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِيثٌ</span> <i>Slow; tardy.</i> (K.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَبِيثٌ</span>.]

